<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> Sydney Bulldogs  17  South Queensland  16  Brisbane	   38  Gold Coast	  10</p>
<p> North Sydney     46  South Sydney	 4</p>
<p> Illawarra	  42  Penrith		2</p>
